We summarize the contributions of HYBGRAG as follows:
- Agentic:** it automatically refines the question routing with self-reflection;
- Adaptive:** it solves textual, relational and hybrid questions with a unified framework;
- Interpretable:** it justifies the decision making with intuitive refinement path; and
- Effective:** it outperforms all baselines on real-world HQA benchmarks.

To solve hybrid question answering (HQA), we propose HYBGRAG, driven by insights from our empirical analysis, which has following advantages:
- Agentic:** it refines question routing with self-reflection by our critic module;
- Adaptive:** it solves textual, relational and hybrid questions by our retriever bank;
- Interpretable:** it justifies the decision making with intuitive refinement path; and
- Effective:** it significantly outperforms all the baselines on HQA benchmarks.
Applied on STARK, HYBGRAG achieves an average relative improvement 51% in Hit@1.
